From: Pobega <pobega@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add D-Pad to Left Analog Stick core option with attack ramp

Add reicast_dpad_to_analog (disabled, analog, both),
reicast_dpad_to_analog_ramp (instant, fast, medium, slow; default medium),
and reicast_dpad_to_analog_sensitivity (40%-100%; default 100%) to route
D-Pad inputs smoothly to the Dreamcast Left Analog Stick on stickless handhelds.
---
 shell/libretro/libretro.cpp            | 155 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 shell/libretro/libretro_core_options.h |  48 ++++++++++
 2 files changed, 193 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

